<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka says to go ahead with estate sale.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka says to go ahead with estate sale.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka is to go ahead with the delayed privatisation of Namunukula Plantations Ltd and sell a 51 percent stake on the stock exchange on Thursday, the Public Enterprise Reform Commission (PERC) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The revised date for the sale will be June 5 at a minimum bid price of 40 rupees a share,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
